SOC Lab Setup Steps:

1. Create virtual machines via VMware
  a. Windows 10 (target)
  b. Kali Linux (attacker)

2. Install SIEM tool, Splunk on to host machine
  a. Add Splunk Universal Forwarder to Windows VM

3. Enable logging on Windows
  a. Event logs
    i. security 
    ii. authentication  
    iii. system
  b. PowerShell logging 
  c. Windows system event logging  (sysmon)

4. Ingest logs into SIEM 
  a. verify following logs are coming in:
    i. failed and successful authenitcation
    ii. process execution
